# gemini        = Google Gemini via its OpenAI-style API (free tier)       -> paste GEMINI_API_KEY below
# gemma         = Google Gemma 4 31B hosted by Google (same key, free tier)
# local         = a model running on your own machine via Ollama (e.g. Gemma 4 small), no internet needed
